    "description": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>6-Month Full-Stack & DSA Revision Module</title>\n  <style>\n    /* Reset & Base Styles */\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: #000000;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    /* Container Card */\n    .pamphlet-container {\n      max-width: 900px;\n      width: 100%;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 2px solid #000000;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    /* Header Section */\n    .header {\n      background-color: #000000;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      padding: 40px 30px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .header h1 {\n      font-size: 2.2rem;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .header p {\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      color: #cccccc;\n      max-width: 700px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .badge {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: #000000;\n      padding: 6px 16px;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    /* Layout Content Sections */\n    .content {\n      padding: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      color: #000000;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    /* Highlight Banner */\n    .highlight-box {\n      background-color: #f2f2f2;\n      color: #000000;\n      border: 1px solid #000000;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      margin-bottom: 35px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    .highlight-box strong {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n\n    /* Grid for Topics */\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n      gap: 20px;\n      margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid #000000;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .card h3 {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      color: #000000;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #cccccc;\n      padding-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .card ul {\n      list-style-type: none;\n    }\n\n    .card ul li {\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #333333;\n      position: relative;\n      padding-left: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .card ul li::before {\n      content: \"•\";\n      color: #000000;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Learning Flow Timeline */\n    .timeline {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 15px;\n      margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n\n    .step {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 15px;\n      background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      padding: 15px 20px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      border: 1px solid #000000;\n    }\n\n    .step-number {\n      background-color: #000000;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .step-text h4 {\n      color: #000000;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n    }\n\n    .step-text p {\n      color: #444444;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Callouts: Prerequisites & Outcomes */\n    .two-column {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n      gap: 20px;\n      margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n\n    .info-box {\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      border: 2px solid #000000;\n    }\n\n    .info-box h3 {\n      color: #000000;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .info-box ul {\n      list-style-type: none;\n    }\n\n    .info-box ul li {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #222222;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer / CTA */\n    .footer {\n      text-align: center;\n      background-color: #000000;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      padding: 30px 25px;\n    }\n\n    .footer h3 {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .footer p {\n      color: #cccccc;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      color: #000000;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      padding: 12px 30px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      border: 1px solid #ffffff;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .btn:hover {\n      background-color: #cccccc;\n      border-color: #cccccc;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"pamphlet-container\">\n    \n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <h1>Full-Stack & DSA Revision Module</h1>\n      <p>Consolidate your knowledge, bridge your skill gaps, and get ready to level up your software engineering career in 6 months.</p>\n      <span class=\"badge\">6-Month Structured Program</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      \n      <!-- Value Proposition Banner -->\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n        <strong>Stop worrying about \"What should I study today?\"</strong>\n        We provide a clear daily and weekly schedule covering every topic end-to-end. Focus 100% of your energy on revising, practicing, and mastering concepts.\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Curriculum Overview -->\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">What You Will Revise</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        \n        <!-- DSA Card -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3>Data Structures & Algorithms</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Arrays & Strings</li>\n            <li>Linked Lists, Stacks & Queues</li>\n            <li>Trees, BSTs & Graphs</li>\n            <li>Recursion & Dynamic Programming</li>\n            <li>Sorting & Searching Algorithms</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Frontend Card -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3>Frontend Engineering</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>JavaScript Fundamentals & ES6+</li>\n            <li>DOM Manipulation & Async JS</li>\n            <li>React: Hooks, State & Context</li>\n            <li>Next.js: SSR, SSG & App Router</li>\n            <li>Tailwind CSS & Responsive Design</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Backend Card -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3>Backend & Databases</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Node.js & Express Architecture</li>\n            <li>SQL (PostgreSQL / MySQL)</li>\n            <li>MongoDB & Document Modeling</li>\n            <li>RESTful APIs & GraphQL</li>\n            <li>Authentication (JWT, OAuth)</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Deployment Card -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3>DevOps & Deployment</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>AWS (EC2, S3, CloudFront)</li>\n            <li>Docker Containerization</li>\n            <li>Process Management with PM2</li>\n            <li>CI/CD Pipelines (GitHub Actions)</li>\n            <li>Nginx Reverse Proxy & SSL Setup</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Learning Flow -->\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">How You Will Learn & Revise</h2>\n      <div class=\"timeline\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"step-text\">\n            <h4>Concept Flash Refresher</h4>\n            <p>Rapid core concept reviews without the fluff—focusing on common interview patterns and practical usage.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"step-text\">\n            <h4>Targeted Problem Solving</h4>\n            <p>Handpicked DSA problems and Frontend/Backend coding challenges tailored to reinforce key ideas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n          <div class=\"step-text\">\n            <h4>System Design & Integration</h4>\n            <p>Connect the dots by building and deploying full-stack components onto cloud platforms.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Prerequisites & Outcomes -->\n      <div class=\"two-column\">\n        \n        <!-- Prerequisites -->\n        <div class=\"info-box\">\n          <h3>Prerequisites</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>[!] <strong>Not for absolute beginners:</strong> Requires prior understanding of programming basics.</li>\n            <li>[✓] For developers looking to quickly brush up on DSA & Full-Stack concepts.</li>\n            <li>[✓] For working engineers preparing to switch companies or clear mid-to-senior interviews.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Outcomes -->\n        <div class=\"info-box\">\n          <h3>Expected Outcomes</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>[✓] <strong>Job-Ready Confidence:</strong> Clear live coding and architecture rounds easily.</li>\n            <li>[✓] <strong>DSA Problem Solving:</strong> Faster pattern recognition and clean code execution.</li>\n            <li>[✓] <strong>Production Mastery:</strong> Deploy scalable full-stack applications with industry tools.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer / Call to Action -->\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <h3>Ready to Accelerate Your Career?</h3>\n      <p>Commit to 6 months of structured revision and transform your engineering profile.</p>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Start Revision Today</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
